sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as React client
  participant API as Express API
  participant V as Validation + rate limit
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  S->>UI: enter email and password
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
  API->>V: rate limit check, zod schema
  alt invalid payload
    V-->>UI: 400 Validation failed
  else valid
    API->>DB: SELECT student by email
    DB-->>API: student row (password_hash)
    API->>API: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    alt wrong email or password
      API-->>UI: 401 Invalid email or password
    else correct
      API->>API: sign JWT (sub = student_id, expiry)
      API-->>UI: 200 token + student
      UI->>UI: store token, redirect to dashboard
    end
  end
